# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets honors this file. It complements the
# "Always Use HTTPS" redirect (set in the Cloudflare dashboard) by advertising
# HSTS so browsers upgrade to HTTPS before the first request, and hardens
# responses. Canonical tags already point to the HTTPS origin, so combined
# with HSTS the http:// URLs seen in Search Console consolidate to https.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
